# ✅ Insertion Sort (Adaptive & Stable)

### 🔹 Code (C)
```c
#include <stdio.h>

void insertionSort(int a[], int n) {
    int i, key, j;
    for(i = 1; i < n; i++) {
        key = a[i];
        j = i - 1;

        while(j >= 0 && a[j] > key) {
            a[j + 1] = a[j];
            j--;
        }
        a[j + 1] = key;
    }
}

int main() {
    int a[] = {12, 11, 13, 5, 6};
    int n = sizeof(a)/sizeof(a[0]);

    insertionSort(a, n);

    printf("Sorted: ");
    for(int i=0; i<n; i++)
        printf("%d ", a[i]);
}
```

### Time Complexity
